WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.732
- Please say a big hello
there to Tabitha Brown.

00:00:04.732 --> 00:00:07.065
(applause)

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.740
I can't believe you're here.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.870
I'm geeking out!

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:12.840
- My goodness.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.760
I'm so excited.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.380
I can't believe I'm here.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.003
- All right, Tabitha. What are we cooking?

00:00:19.373 --> 00:00:20.250
- You ready to eat?

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.220
- [Drew] I am ready to eat.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.290
I don't know why, but my hips are moving.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.874
I don't know what that's about, but.

00:00:25.874 --> 00:00:28.110
- You know, we dance when we hungry,

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.420
and we know it's going to be good,

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:31.550
and we dance sometimes. That's how it be.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.480
- It's true. And the
grilled cheese is truly one

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.640
of my very favorite
things on planet earth.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.460
So I'm really, really excited.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.870
- I love a good grilled cheese.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.140
And you know, when I want to

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.630
make myself feel like I'm doing something

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:46.900
a little fancy, I add my
spinach and my garlic.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:47.990
Shall we make one?

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.280
- Yes. And I think your approach

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.870
to this honestly, is
something I've never seen.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:57.160
So teach us, Tabitha,
teach us your brilliance.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.590
- Here we go--okay. So first real simple.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.220
We take our wheat bread, right?

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:04.300
One slice. Let's get a
little bit of butter.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.240
Okay.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.770
We're gonna put our butter on the bread.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.330
And we do this for two reasons.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.164
One, so we can have it like,
nice brown toasted look.

00:01:13.164 --> 00:01:13.997
- Mhm.

00:01:13.997 --> 00:01:15.800
- But also, the cheese and the spinach

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.240
sticks on to the butter.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.370
Okay? Because we're going
to put it on the outside.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.913
- So the butter kind
of acts as an adhesive.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.570
- Yeah. It's like the glue.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.140
This is the outside of the bread.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:26.973
So don't put too much.

00:01:26.973 --> 00:01:28.240
This is the outside.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.300
- Oh, did I overdo it?

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.220
I do that in the kitchen.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.320
I overdo it.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.180
I have no art of subtlety in the kitchen.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.570
- Put a little bit of
garlic powder on the bread.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.860
Like, so like that.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:42.110
- See, I would never think to do this.

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.107
- Cool, girl. Okay, so then--go ahead.

00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:46.100
And we put it face down with all

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.343
your coverings in your skillet.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.423
Okay. Do that. Then while--

00:01:52.423 --> 00:01:54.509
- It's sizzling!

00:01:54.509 --> 00:01:59.262
- [Tabitha] Yeah. And then
go ahead and add your cheese.

00:01:59.262 --> 00:02:00.095
All right.

00:02:00.095 --> 00:02:02.190
- And this is vegan cheese.

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:03.040
- [Tabitha] Yeah.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:06.880
All right. Now go ahead and
put your other one on top.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:08.673
All right.

00:02:08.673 --> 00:02:09.980
And we'll get ready to flip it.

00:02:13.553 --> 00:02:14.790
Flip it.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.013
Cheese melts quick.

00:02:17.611 --> 00:02:21.000
(audience cheers)

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.030
- I love it.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.500
I have such a, like, support team here.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.020
This is so cool.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:26.853
What do you say?

00:02:26.853 --> 00:02:28.270
Don't go ruin nobody's day now?

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:30.250
Can you say it for me?

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.880
- You have to say, have
yourself a good day,

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.890
but even if you can't have a good one,

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:37.332
don't go messing up nobody
else's. That's how my--

00:02:37.332 --> 00:02:38.165
(applause)

00:02:38.165 --> 00:02:39.292
My daddy always told me that.

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:42.193
He still tells me that
today, he always says that.

00:02:42.193 --> 00:02:44.250
So I have one that is already finished.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.083
Do you?

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:46.440
Cause this one, the cheese is melted,

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:47.710
but I want you to just--

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.460
- I, I think mine is good.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.390
Now, how do you like to cut your bread,

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.710
or do you leave it whole?

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.370
- Oh girl. No, you know we gotta,

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.160
we have to cut and you know,
like a little triangle.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.530
Make us feel like a kid again sometimes.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.716
- [Drew] This is stunning by the way.

00:03:04.716 --> 00:03:05.549
(applause)

00:03:05.549 --> 00:03:07.643
Okay. Tabitha, how did I do?

00:03:08.698 --> 00:03:10.310
- Oh, you did amazing, girl.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:12.487
Look at you, showing off in the kitchen.

00:03:12.487 --> 00:03:14.630
(laughs)

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.742
This is when you dance,
cause you did it, yeah.

00:03:17.742 --> 00:03:20.440
(laughs) Come on, girl.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:23.230
Yeah, girl. That's what we do. So, yeah.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.321
- Can I taste it now?

00:03:25.321 --> 00:03:26.553
(claps)

00:03:26.553 --> 00:03:27.600
- Girl, that is the best part.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.170
Oh God, we thank you.
Yes, we're gonna taste it.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.780
Amen to that.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.425
Ready? Mm.

00:03:33.425 --> 00:03:35.675
(applause)

00:03:38.349 --> 00:03:40.516
(laughs)

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.710
- That garlic powder is so extraordinary.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:50.200
It's such a unique flavor
and goes so well with it.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.480
I would have never thought to have--

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.283
I might just have to take another bite.

00:03:54.162 --> 00:03:58.270
- That's your business.
You take two bites.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:02.670
- Oh my god. Tabitha, thank you so much

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.150
for changing my perspective

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.080
on the grilled cheese as well as life.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.679
Thank you Tabitha.

00:04:07.679 --> 00:04:09.100
(applause)

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:09.933
I can't help it.

00:04:09.933 --> 00:04:10.766
I love you.

00:04:10.766 --> 00:04:13.112
I would love to hang out with you again.

00:04:13.112 --> 00:04:14.603
- Girl, we'll get together.

00:04:14.603 --> 00:04:17.190
I love you back. (laughs)

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.640
- I need you, Tabitha.

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:21.331
Thank you so much for being here.

00:04:21.331 --> 00:04:23.998
(upbeat music)

